    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want to experience the fun of rapidly expanding your territory? Then come and play this &quot;Quick Territory Expansion&quot; game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459810/extras/1e170ad9da2a9bc1af3e4184974ebcb4.avif?t=1745731606\" width=150 height=150 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459810/extras/4d1e6077241c151214b56a627ca507ae.avif?t=1745731606\" width=150 height=161 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459810/extras/975edac45778667c8e545f891c5ac2d1.avif?t=1745731606\" width=150 height=164 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459810/extras/35eb8af0e1e0740b2a286fb60445b21f.avif?t=1745731606\" width=150 height=151 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Plan land resources</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Increase the amount of usable land by clearing forests or broadleaf forests.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adjacent farms and villages will generate more revenue.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459810/extras/dd3787a7e0f68e7116dff76d4bbe510b.avif?t=1745731606\" width=150 height=164 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459810/extras/6d3198d0453ed70fe17d739777dac2d0.avif?t=1745731606\" width=150 height=192 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459810/extras/76c329c4cfed492a65aacf07130bc386.avif?t=1745731606\" width=150 height=174 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459810/extras/208e2727163b54518af8ace6ff9696a7.avif?t=1745731606\" width=150 height=206 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Respond to internal kingdom challenges</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the game, a large population is both the foundation of the kingdom's strength and a challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The population can be used for conscription or arranged for production.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maintain the kingdom's ruling power through soldiers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ruling power is the basis for the stability and high output of the kingdom; the more population you have, the more soldiers you need to maintain the kingdom's ruling power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Population, lack of housing, unemployed civilians, rioters, and high war weariness will all reduce the kingdom's ruling power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459810/extras/d0eb6b222271a7e3d21956cedcdf9906.avif?t=1745731606\" width=150 height=196 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459810/extras/947f108c1341cffa9fb904d54a0eef54.avif?t=1745731606\" width=150 height=164 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459810/extras/4de17a363db0814123993a2d09039f7e.avif?t=1745731606\" width=150 height=207 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459810/extras/35538f7c65188f373cb715b493fc9267.avif?t=1745731606\" width=150 height=165 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Respond to external kingdom challenges</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build fortresses, barracks, and other defensive structures to fend off threats from neighboring kingdoms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >War brings great resource consumption; also, avoid losing too many soldiers, as this will disrupt the internal stability of the kingdom, leading to crises and even collapse.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want to experience the fun of rapidly expanding your territory? Then come and play this &quot;Quick Territory Expansion&quot; game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459810/extras/1e170ad9da2a9bc1af3e4184974ebcb4.avif?t=1745731606\" width=150 height=150 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459810/extras/4d1e6077241c151214b56a627ca507ae.avif?t=1745731606\" width=150 height=161 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459810/extras/975edac45778667c8e545f891c5ac2d1.avif?t=1745731606\" width=150 height=164 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459810/extras/35eb8af0e1e0740b2a286fb60445b21f.avif?t=1745731606\" width=150 height=151 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Plan land resources</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Increase the amount of usable land by clearing forests or broadleaf forests.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adjacent farms and villages will generate more revenue.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459810/extras/dd3787a7e0f68e7116dff76d4bbe510b.avif?t=1745731606\" width=150 height=164 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459810/extras/6d3198d0453ed70fe17d739777dac2d0.avif?t=1745731606\" width=150 height=192 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459810/extras/76c329c4cfed492a65aacf07130bc386.avif?t=1745731606\" width=150 height=174 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459810/extras/208e2727163b54518af8ace6ff9696a7.avif?t=1745731606\" width=150 height=206 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Respond to internal kingdom challenges</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the game, a large population is both the foundation of the kingdom's strength and a challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The population can be used for conscription or arranged for production.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maintain the kingdom's ruling power through soldiers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ruling power is the basis for the stability and high output of the kingdom; the more population you have, the more soldiers you need to maintain the kingdom's ruling power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Population, lack of housing, unemployed civilians, rioters, and high war weariness will all reduce the kingdom's ruling power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459810/extras/d0eb6b222271a7e3d21956cedcdf9906.avif?t=1745731606\" width=150 height=196 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459810/extras/947f108c1341cffa9fb904d54a0eef54.avif?t=1745731606\" width=150 height=164 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459810/extras/4de17a363db0814123993a2d09039f7e.avif?t=1745731606\" width=150 height=207 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459810/extras/35538f7c65188f373cb715b493fc9267.avif?t=1745731606\" width=150 height=165 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Respond to external kingdom challenges</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build fortresses, barracks, and other defensive structures to fend off threats from neighboring kingdoms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >War brings great resource consumption; also, avoid losing too many soldiers, as this will disrupt the internal stability of the kingdom, leading to crises and even collapse.</p>",
    "short_description": "&quot;Expand the Kingdom&quot; is a strategy game based on construction and expansion. In the game, you need to expand and plan land, acquire resources to maintain the internal balance of the kingdom, and survive and defeat all opponents in the competition between kingdoms.",
